From 9526fd1e8e433f41b2cfc6bb9c055910063837f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:55:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] kboot: T6050: hand the J714s camera over on 27.2

Add a J714s 27.2 (26B123) row to the T6050 camera table. The J714s identity
of UniversalMac_27.2_26B123 loads Firmware/isp_bni/adc-nyx-sc7x.im4p (uuid
889F5ADB-BDE7-3B93-A531-24587C4CF3D5), whose TEXT (0xc1c000) and DATA
(0x13d0000) match the two segments the hand-off requires, as on 27.0 and
27.3 beta 1. The sensor type (0x74) and the ADT segment-ranges are checked
at boot as for every row, so a different ADT refuses the hand-off.

Not booted: no J714s has run a 27.2 stub.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/kboot.c | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/kboot.c b/src/kboot.c
index c12b625e..201e0b7a 100644
--- a/src/kboot.c
+++ b/src/kboot.c
@@ -9378,7 +9378,8 @@ t6050_isp_segments_valid(const struct adt_segment_ranges *seg, u32 len, u64 ram,
  * snapshot physical addresses. The kernel allocates the small main-memory
  * tail and owns all power, DART and firmware-start operations. J716c's camera
  * is sensor type 0x75, J714s's 0x74 (both measured on 27.0; the J714s also on
- * 27.3 beta 1), K116s's 0xbc (27.2); all three have the same two segments.
+ * 27.3 beta 1, and 27.2 from its IPSW), K116s's 0xbc (27.2); all three have the
+ * same two segments.
  */
 __attribute__((section(".init.t6050_isp"))) static int t6050_isp_add_mem_region(uint32_t phandle,
                                                                                 const char *name)
@@ -9404,6 +9405,13 @@ static const struct {
      * type and the same two segments (TEXT 0xc1c000, DATA 0x13d0000 at remap 0x10000000000).
      */
     {"apple,j714s", 0x74, V27_3B1},
+    /*
+     * J714s on the 27.2 stub (26B123): the J714s identity's ISP firmware, isp_bni/adc-nyx-sc7x
+     * (uuid 889F5ADB-BDE7-3B93-A531-24587C4CF3D5), has 27.0's TEXT 0xc1c000 and DATA 0x13d0000
+     * (read from the IPSW). The sensor type and the ADT segments are checked at boot as for the
+     * other rows; not booted yet.
+     */
+    {"apple,j714s", 0x74, V27_2},
     /*
      * K116s: ADT isp0 of 27.2 (26B8125). Firmware uuid 980F533B-34EA-3FBA-878C-809F6AF57345,
      * the IPSW's isp_bni/adc-nyx-sck11pm; its K116 connection table has one FrontRGB IMX958.
